put.description:
Accepts a dictionary of 2D coordinates of one or more cortical areas and update them in genome.

Input format:

{
    "region_id_1": {
        "coordinate_2d": [10, 9],
        "parent_region_id": "fhafsihwfiuhr23r_b",
    },
    "region_id_2": {
        "coordinate_2d": [4, 93],
        "parent_region_id": "dhdfsihwfiuhr23r_b",
    },
    "cortical_area_id": {
        "coordinate_2d": [30, 29],
        "parent_region_id": "gdfsihwfiuhr23r_b",
    }
}

